import Link from "next/link";import{notFound}from"next/navigation";import{requireProfile}from"@/lib/auth";import{createClient}from"@/lib/supabase/server";import{EventWorkspaceHeader}from"@/components/event/event-workspace-header";import{Badge,ButtonLink,Card,Empty}from"@/components/ui";import{categoryLabel}from"@/lib/constants";import{ChevronRightIcon}from"@/components/icons";
type S="needed"|"searching"|"inquired"|"quote"|"payment"|"booked";const tone=(s:S)=>s==="booked"?"green":s==="payment"||s==="quote"?"amber":s==="inquired"||s==="searching"?"plum":"slate";const text=(s:S)=>s==="booked"?"Booked":s==="payment"?"Awaiting payment":s==="quote"?"Quote received":s==="inquired"?"Inquiry sent":s==="searching"?"Searching":"Needed";
export default async function Page({params}:{params:{id:string}}){await requireProfile();const db=createClient();const{data:event}=await db.from("events").select("*").eq("id",params.id).single();if(!event)notFound();const[{data:needs},{data:requests},{data:quotes},{data:bookings},{data:vendors}]=await Promise.all([db.from("event_vendor_needs").select("*").eq("event_id",params.id),db.from("event_requests").select("*").eq("event_id",params.id),db.from("quotes").select("*").eq("event_id",params.id),db.from("bookings").select("*").eq("event_id",params.id),db.from("vendors").select("id,business_name")]);const names=new Map((vendors??[]).map(v=>[v.id,v.business_name]));const rows=(needs??[]).map(n=>{const b=(bookings??[]).find(x=>x.category===n.category&&x.status!=="cancelled"),q=(quotes??[]).find(x=>x.category===n.category&&x.status!=="declined"&&x.status!=="expired"),r=(requests??[]).find(x=>x.category===n.category);let status:S=n.status==="searching"?"searching":"needed",detail;if(b){status=b.status==="pending_deposit"?"payment":"booked";detail=names.get(b.vendor_id)}else if(q){status="quote";detail=names.get(q.vendor_id)}else if(r){status="inquired";detail=names.get(r.vendor_id)}return{...n,status,detail}});const booked=rows.filter(r=>r.status==="booked").length;return <div className="space-y-7"><EventWorkspaceHeader event={event} active="/vendors" eyebrow="Vendor Needs"/><div className="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4"><div><p className="fleora-kicker">Source it</p><h1 className="mt-1 font-display text-4xl">Find My Vendors</h1><p className="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-sm text-ink-600">Fleora turned everything you marked Hire into one sourcing list, so you can build your event team without starting from scratch.</p></div><ButtonLink href={`/events/${event.id}/summary`} variant="secondary">View Party Plan Summary</ButtonLink></div><div className="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3"><Card><p className="text-xs font-bold uppercase text-ink-400">Vendor needs</p><p className="mt-1 font-display text-3xl">{rows.length}</p></Card><Card><p className="text-xs font-bold uppercase text-ink-400">Still sourcing</p><p className="mt-1 font-display text-3xl">{rows.length-booked}</p></Card><Card><p className="text-xs font-bold uppercase text-ink-400">Booked</p><p className="mt-1 font-display text-3xl">{booked}</p></Card></div>{rows.length===0?<Empty title="No vendor needs yet"><p>Anything you mark <b>Hire someone</b> in My Party Plan will automatically appear here.</p><div className="mt-4"><ButtonLink href={`/events/${event.id}/plan`}>Go to My Party Plan</ButtonLink></div></Empty>:<div className="space-y-4"><div><p className="fleora-kicker">Your sourcing list</p><h2 className="mt-1 font-display text-3xl">What your party needs</h2></div><div className="grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2">{rows.map(r=><Card key={r.id} variant="interactive"><div className="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><p className="font-display text-2xl">{r.label||categoryLabel(r.category)}</p><p className="mt-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-ink-400">{categoryLabel(r.category)}</p>{r.detail&&<p className="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-600">{r.detail}</p>}</div><Badge tone={tone(r.status)}>{text(r.status)}</Badge></div>{r.notes&&<p className="mt-3 rounded-xl bg-plum-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm">{r.notes}</p>}<div className="mt-4 border-t fleora-divider pt-4">{r.status==="booked"?<Link href={`/events/${event.id}/summary`} className="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-plum-700">View in Party Plan <ChevronRightIcon size={14}/></Link>:r.status==="inquired"||r.status==="quote"||r.status==="payment"?<Link href="/messages" className="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-plum-700">Continue with vendor <ChevronRightIcon size={14}/></Link>:<Link href={`/events/${event.id}/matches/${r.category}`} className="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-plum-700">Find matching vendors <ChevronRightIcon size={14}/></Link>}</div></Card>)}</div></div>}</div>}
